Package: datajud
Title: Access and Download Data from the DataJud API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jose", "User", , "jose@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions to access and download judicial process metadata
    from the DataJud Public API (https://datajud-wiki.cnj.jus.br/api-publica/),
    maintained by the Brazilian National Council of Justice (CNJ). Includes
    functions for searching by CNJ case numbers, custom queries, and retrieving
    data from different Brazilian court systems.
